## 9. What this phase deliberately does not finish

After this phase: four of the six Layer III intelligence-agent nodes (Technical Analyst, Sentiment Analyst, Macro Strategist, Event Specialist) have real, hardened LLM reasoning available, sharing one audited implementation of the security/cost-critical plumbing. `flow-agent` and `contrarian-agent` remain rule-based stubs — the next phase in this sequence should address those two together (they share the property of needing a materially different upstream contract than the other four), and only after that should any future phase attempt Layer IV (ML ensemble) or beyond. Real sentiment/news/macro data ingestion, to make this phase's reasoning substantive rather than proxy-based, remains a distinct, larger, unscheduled future phase — say so plainly, don't imply it's done.